OL,3,GNEWSACases of bluetongue virus
OL,4,Aconfirmed in Shropshire
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour cases of the potentially fatal
OL,7,Fbluetongue virus have been confirmed in
OL,8,FShropshire.
OL,10,FThey are part of the latest figures
OL,11,Ffrom the Department for Environment
OL,12,FFood and Rural Affairs (Defra), which
OL,13,Fbring the total cases in the UK in
OL,14,F2026-27 to 618.
OL,16,FThe locations of the four premises
OL,17,Faffected in Shropshire have not been
OL,18,Fpublicly revealed.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,358,350,200,160,0,100
