OL,3,GNEWSACases of bluetongue virus
OL,4,Aconfirmed in Shropshire
OL,5,
OL,6,FDefra has also not disclosed if the
OL,7,Fcases are in sheep or cattle but a
OL,8,Fspokesperson said, of the 25 new cases
OL,9,Facross the country in the latest
OL,10,Fupdate, 18 involved sheep, six cattle
OL,11,Fand one at a mixed farm affecting both.
